  "Start the encounter when the pack is ready. Rux and the enemy exchange attacks automatically, while healing and armor from the current layout affect each round.": "Comece o encontro quando o pacote estiver pronto. Rux e o inimigo trocam ataques automaticamente, enquanto a cura e a armadura do layout atual afetam cada rodada.",
